            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF146 enables the HTML Sanitizer API by default on nightly. This updates the Experimental features page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that this isn't released and this was previously noted in the FF136 release note, so I haven't added it to the relnote page again.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3547012068\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41649\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41649/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41649\">#41649</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41940",
